# Framework Adapter Governance

**Constitution:** §40–44, §72

## Principle

```text
SIS Core → API/Contracts → UI Adapter → Framework (React/Inertia today)
```

## Forbidden

```text
React business logic A
Vue business logic B
Blazor business logic C
```

## React / Inertia (current)

Must consume: API contracts, permissions, validation errors, design tokens, command naming.

## Future Adapters

Vue, Blazor Hybrid, Electron shell — same contracts. Introduce adapter layer; do not fork handlers or domain rules. Desktop Blazor: `DESKTOP-UI-GOVERNANCE.md` + `16-desktop-ui-governance.mdc`.

## Coexistence

Multiple UI technologies allowed only through stable contracts documented in `UI-CONTRACT.md` and `RUNTIME-CONTRACT.md`.
